4|0@wow^1440570309#cug09wb:ergonelsa$:Enhancement shamans, redesign totems to be an elemental that permanently follows you around, think a pet without a pet bar. When you get into combat, your elemental takes upon one of the four elements and cycles between them every x stacks of maelstrom weapon used. Former totem spells are redesigned to provide 'some' of their effect, but are mainly used to force the elemental to switch to that totems element. Lightning shield changed to Elemental Wrath, generates charges similarly to an ele shaman, upon reaching max charges, can use elemental spell of that current element (Maelstrom for Lightning/ Water, Eruption for Fire/ Earth). Earth shock is gone, replaced with a new Primal Strike. Primal strike deals earth damage in a cone in front of the shaman, split between targets, and summons a low damage, slowing earthquake in that area. Frost shock is replaced with Tidal Wave, summons a blast of water in a nova around the shaman and leaves diseases water in the area, dealing minor damage to enemies and slowing them slightly. Primal strike can only be used while the elemental is on fire/ earth. Tidal wave can only be used in water/ air. Maelstrom. Your tidal waves existing pool of water becomes a vivacious maelstrom, dealing increased damage and sucking enemies to its eye, where they are stunned and take large damage if they cannot escape. Eruption. Your primal strikes earthquake erupts in a cataclysmic display, knocking back enemies who were located on it and dealing massive damage. Lava spews from the three sides of the cone, increasing the area by 150% and dealing damage over time to those initial affected or in it. Both can be glued to remove the unique movement impairing and slightly increase damage for raid setting. Maelstrom weapon is how your weapon wind furies are tracked. One you reach 5 stacks of maelstrom weapon, your weapon windfuries and your elemental shifts to its next aspect. After your elemental swaps to a new aspect, you are locked to that aspect for 30 seconds, unless you ascend, use a 'totem spell' to force to a different aspect, or unleash elements. Unleash elements is now a cooldown that allows your element to infuse you with the power of all 4 elements for 12 seconds ( 3 minute cooldown) Ascending locks you to an aspect, but whilst ascended you cannot use the other aspect abilities ( ascend to earth/ fire, can't use healing spells or wind shear, ascended to water/air? Can't use flame shock/ primal strike) Tl;dr make enhancement shamans do cool shit.
