5% less energy for 5 seconds after leaving stealth", fits with the tier better. Figure something to do with deadly throw, it's changed 10 times, they all suck. Leeching should be baseline offhand poison choice, we have no choices, find another defensive. Cloak and Dagger, Vendetta allows for you to teleport to your target with main combo point generators (Similar to monk epiphany in d3). T5 is fine, no one cares about it. T6 shuriken needs to be baseline, get rid of throw. T7 add two talents to compensate for the above removal, the coolest talent is never used, ever outside of PVP (which doesn't exist this expac atm). Elemental should cycle through elements similar to boomkin but with all 4 elements. Make ret less whack-a-mole Shadowpriest fix everything (there's so much that needs to happen) Raid wise.. Remove class buffs from raids, make it baseline. If you step in the raid you have the buffs. No more having to bring x class for y buff. Remove external CDs pretty much raid wide. 
